{
  "slug": "honeydew",
  "name": "Honeydew",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Honeydew AI plugins for semantic data modeling and data analysis — 9 skills, 3 hooks, multi-platform support.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `attribute-creation` (Guides you step-by-step through defining a calculated attribute (dimension) on a Honeydew entity), `context-item-creation` (Guides you through creating context items — instructions, skills, knowledge pointers, and memory events — that give the…), `conversation-review` (Use when a semantic/context layer curator wants to review past analysis conversations in bulk, categorize user feedback into…), `domain-creation` (Guides you through creating a Honeydew domain — a governance object that scopes entity/field visibility and applies mandatory…), `entity-creation` (Guides you through defining a new Honeydew entity from a data warehouse source — covering source type, granularity…), `filtering` (Use when the user needs to filter data — whether in a structured query, a metric aggregation, or…), `metric-creation` (Guides you step-by-step through defining a business metric (aggregation) on a Honeydew entity), `model-exploration` (Use when exploring Honeydew semantic layer, discovering entities/fields, setting up workspace and branch context, or running structured queries…), and 5 more\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `honeydew`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install honeydew@claude-community` from `honeydew-ai/honeydew-ai-coding-agents-plugins`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
